From: 77450danik <ddziuba1@stu.vistula.edu.pl>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] desk: Personalization instead of the old appearance.

The display's properties show startui.dll's page "Персоналізація"
(ArcticPersonalizePage) where the old appearance page was: the light and
the dark mode as Windows 11 chooses them, for Windows and for programs,
and the look of the title bars. Without startui.dll the old page stays.
---
--- a/dll/cpl/desk/desk.c
+++ b/dll/cpl/desk/desk.c
@@ -230,6 +230,21 @@
         if (pwszSelectedTab && _wcsicmp(pwszSelectedTab, PropPages[i].Name) == 0)
             psh.nStartPage = i;
 
+        /* Arctic: the page "Персоналізація" of startui.dll instead of the
+         * old appearance: the light and the dark mode, as Windows 11 has
+         * them, and the look of the title bars */
+        if (PropPages[i].idDlg == IDD_APPEARANCE)
+        {
+            typedef HPROPSHEETPAGE (WINAPI *PFN_PERSONALIZE_PAGE)(void);
+            HMODULE hStartUi = LoadLibraryW(L"startui.dll");
+            PFN_PERSONALIZE_PAGE pfnPage = hStartUi ?
+                (PFN_PERSONALIZE_PAGE)GetProcAddress(hStartUi, "ArcticPersonalizePage") : NULL;
+            HPROPSHEETPAGE hPage = pfnPage ? pfnPage() : NULL;
+
+            if (hPage && DisplayAppletPropSheetAddPage(hPage, (LPARAM)&psh))
+                continue;
+        }
+
         /* Override the background page if requested by a shell extension */
         if (PropPages[i].idDlg == IDD_BACKGROUND && hpsxa != NULL &&
             SHReplaceFromPropSheetExtArray(hpsxa, CPLPAGE_DISPLAY_BACKGROUND, DisplayAppletPropSheetAddPage, (LPARAM)&psh) != 0)
